.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:62:- **AP’s corrected 6.266–8.721 W range is still not a universal bound:** its own audit reports powers below p⁰. Its 0.744-dB example concerns an isolated beam, not a demonstrated +2.883% network effect. \(\sum\sqrt p\) decomposition is accounting, not causal separation of renewal from membership changes.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:67:- **HA’s proposed RANDOM≤BASE expectation is wrong as an acceptance criterion.** Only NULL equality is mandatory; random improvement is a reportable diagnostic. Forward-link adaptive power is also a legitimate architecture, so “all downlinks must use fixed RF” is too strong. [DVB implementation guide §4.1.2](https://dvb.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/a171-1_s2_guide.pdf)
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:71:1. **Identity and scope.** The primary candidate is a fixed-RF, fixed-boresight-EIRP forward link with ACM: directional EIRP still varies with antenna gain. The endpoint is full-buffer decodable PHY bits per modeled partial-payload joule. This is the paper’s system model.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:74:4. **Transmission.** Equal-airtime, full-band TDM among the assigned users of each beam. All users’ wanted signals and every interference contribution use the same actual beam RF. No segment-entry gain, recurrence, reset target or private-power/beam-max hybrid survives.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:78:8. **ACM profile.** Use all 28 entries of EN 302 307-1 V1.4.1 Table 13, normal frames, no pilots; select the eligible mode with greatest efficiency. Choose roll-off \(\alpha=0.20\). For table entries \((e_m,g_m)\), use \(SE_m=e_m/1.20\) and \(\gamma_{m,\mathrm{dB}}=g_m+M-10\log_{10}(1.20)\). Freeze the transcribed table and its hash. [Table 13 and shaping rule](https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/302300_302399/30230701/01.04.01_60/en_30230701v010401p.pdf)
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:79:9. **Margin.** \(M=1.7\) dB is a prospective common receiver allowance taken from the reported upper 32APSK implementation loss; applying it across modes is this model’s choice. It is not a complete satellite distortion budget. [ITU-R BO.1784-1, attachment §1](https://www.itu.int/dms_pubrec/itu-r/rec/bo/R-REC-BO.1784-1-201612-I!!PDF-E.pdf)
