.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:89:12. **Energy.** For interval pieces \(k\), \(E=\sum_k\delta_k\{\sum_{b\in\mathcal I_w}[z_{bk}(0.338+\max(P_{\rm idle},P_{\rm PA}(p_{bk})))+(1-z_{bk})P_{\rm idle}]+0.200N_{\rm active\,sat,k}+P_{\rm bus}\}\). An active satellite has at least one transmitting beam. Coefficients come from [the retained component model](/home/sat/mcrl-leo-handover-e1/src/mcrl/env/link_budget.py:270); beam↔chain assignment is a benchmark assumption.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:90:13. **Inventory/boundary.** \(\mathcal I_w\) is a manifest of physical NORAD/beam-chain identities fixed before actions and reused across arms and scored horizons; candidate slots do not define hardware. Primary \(P_{\rm idle}=0\), with ideal boundary switching; \(P_{\rm bus}=0\) denotes exclusion of bus, terminal, gateway and controller energy. Do not claim spacecraft EE or physically zero procedure energy.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:91:14. **Standby sensitivity.** Use \(P_{\rm idle}=fP_{\rm PA}(1.65)\), \(f=35/420=1/12\), hence 0.698609768 W/chain. The cited ratio is from a ground Ka-band HPA’s mute/active prime-power ratings; transplanting it to this model is an engineering proxy, with flight applicability `VERIFY_SOURCE`. The active-floor clamp prevents “turn on at tiny RF to evade standby.” [CPI MKT-497, p.2](https://www.cpii.com/docs/datasheets/826/MKT-497%20SA49KOA_SB49KOA%2080%20W%20SSPA_SSPB.pdf)
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:96:19. **Actions.** Retain 28 association actions, four cached satellite identities, seven local cells and four-decision refresh; these are candidate restrictions, not minimum residence. NO_OP remains legal exactly for an empty mask. Joint SINR is not an independently guaranteeable per-user legality mask; outage does not authorize hidden rescue.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:103:26. **C2 historical replacements.** Replace `previous_recurrence_power` with incumbent nominal decoding margin; gain-to-entry ratio with forecast SE trend; `segment_age` with remaining D2/visibility time. Retain `missing_incumbent` as a service-state flag; add refresh phase. Apply this migration to Q1’s historical tail as well as actual Q2 consumers.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:104:27. **C2 forecast schema.** For every action include background occupancy, beam/satellite activation, current decoding margin, remaining visibility and refresh phase; for each of three future offsets include validity, survival, minimum decoding margin and mean ACM SE. Alternative power-control settings additionally carry required-power/cap margin. Freeze units, shapes and calibration-based normalization under new schema hashes.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:106:29. **C3.** A set-level consolidation coordinator operates on complete proposals, scores whole configurations with the same system objective/QoS terms, and commits atomically. BASE is always present and wins ties. Include unilateral proposals and genuine multi-user evacuations; count actual changed users, not catalogue labels. S0 uses deployable nominal physics; learned S3 must additionally beat matched S0.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:116:3. **Handover-count invariance:** identical radiation, activation and geometry histories with different bookkeeping/event counts have identical E. Interruption changes B only. Actual moves to different physical states need not preserve energy in power-control alternatives.
