.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:127:14. **Memoryless control:** doubling isolated nominal channel gain halves required unsaturated RF; history changes do nothing. Exercise coupled convergence, cap binding, lower-MODCOD operation and solver failure without reused prior power.
.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-controller-handoff-20260907/ADJUDICATION-PHYSICS-EE-ROUND3-CONSOLIDATION-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-ULTRA-2026-09-08.md:128:15. **Standby inventory:** a dark chain contributes exactly \(0.698609768\delta\) J in the cited-proxy setting; changing candidate enumeration changes nothing. Tiny active RF cannot evade the standby floor.
