+              f"Only two worker processes were used. No test split, learner, training job, or policy run was opened. Runner SHA-256: `{receipt['runner_sha256']}`; corrected margin source SHA-256: `{receipt['margin_source_sha256']}`; probe SHA-256: `{receipt['probe_source_sha256']}`. Reference source was read-only at commit `{receipt['reference_commit']}`; the virtual environment was not modified.", "",
+              "## Scope", "",
