codex
While reviewing the still-unselected control trace, I found a semantic edge case: a `+1` offset from an occupancy whose contracted target is already beyond the highest ACM rung was wrapping to the lowest rung, and a no-mode trace could be mislabeled as the first mode. Those are implementation defects, not outcomes. I’m stopping before selection, correcting them so “up” stays infeasible and `NO_MODE` is explicit, then rerunning all anchors from scratch.
